{
  "note": "Hand-computed per-query metric cases. Every expected value was computed from the protocol's formulas by hand, not read back from the runner: the per-pair aggregate is the median with the lower middle value on an even count, pairwise_accuracy counts decided within-query pairs over the rated subset, top1_margin is the arm's top ranked rated candidate minus the rated mean, and topk_mean uses k = min(10, rated subset size).",
